# Against two REAL bridges, part 3: Bob's bridge is back. The failed message is sent again BY HAND (the Retry button, reached
# by keys: the field, Send, Retry) and is delivered; then the conversation is deleted (only on this deck).
title Reticulum: two real bridges, retry by hand, delete the conversation
sizes 640x480

wait 3500
expect text "service: running  OK"
key down
key enter
wait 800
key enter
wait 800
key down
key down
key enter
wait 1000
shot real-retry-before
expect text "Retry"
key enter
wait 500
key esc
wait 500
key down
wait 500
key down
wait 500
key enter
wait 1500
shot real-retry-sending
wait 60000
shot real-retry-delivered
expect notext "Failed, contact may be offline"
key down
wait 500
key enter
wait 800
shot real-options
expect text "Delete conversation"
key down
key enter
wait 500
expect text "Delete conversation?"
key enter
wait 1500
shot real-after-delete
expect text "Send a message"
key esc
wait 400
key esc
wait 400
key esc
expect quit
